                            璇勪环缁撴灉
                        </h3>
                        <div class="metrics-grid">
                            <div class="metric-item">
                                <div class="metric-value" id="step6-oa">--</div>
                                <div class="metric-label">鎬讳綋绮惧害 (OA)</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="metric-item">
